⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
133 calories 22g protein (for the entire pint, not including mix-ins)
Protein Cotton Candy Blizzard 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g @lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 1g (¼ tsp) @LorAnn Oils Cotton Candy flavoring
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
*Use whatever kind of pink and purple sprinkles or candy you can find. I’m not including them in the macros because they will vary greatly depending on what you use.
133 cal 10g C, 0g F, 22g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
5. If powdery, scrape down the sides of the pint with a butter knife, and spin on “Respin” setting (if not, move on to step 6)
6. Top with the sprinkles or candy

